WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Scotland, 1996.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.240
A lamb called Dolly is born
at the Roslin Institute.

3
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:10.200
She is the first mammal ever
cloned from an adult cell.

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:16.090
In 2018, a scientist in China announced
twin girls whose genes he had edited.

5
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.990
He was widely condemned, and jailed.

6
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.210
If we can choose or
change an embryo's genes,

7
00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.540
where does curing disease end,
and designing children begin?

8
00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.120
In this mission, you'll see how embryos
can be tested for a serious genetic disease

9
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.440
before a pregnancy begins.

10
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.790
Then you'll place each new
technology along that line,

11
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.750
from treating disease
to designing a child.

12
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:45.010
Your mission: weigh up where curing
disease ends and designing children begins.
